  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroecology and Safe food System Transitions (ASSET) in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: is to make food and agricultural systems in Southeast Asia more sustainable, safer and inclusive, through harnessing the potential of Agroecology to transform them. This will be achieved through synergizing initiatives contributing to Agroecological and Safe food System Transitions (ASSET) from local to regional levels.</narrative>
  </description>
